<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Discussion</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Additional related works</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this subsection, we discuss additional related work on general test-time adaptation. Many of these methods have inspired recent advances in TTA algorithms for VLMs.</p>
</div>
<section id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Generic test-time adaptation (TTA)</h5>

<div id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Most TTA methods aim to improve model accuracy by optimizing a carefully designed unsupervised loss on unlabeled test data. A prominent line of work minimizes the entropy of model predictions, based on the intuition that entropy quantifies prediction uncertainty. Pioneered by Tent <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib38" title="" class="ltx_ref">38</a>]</cite>, these methods typically update the running statistics and affine parameters of batch normalization <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib17" title="" class="ltx_ref">17</a>]</cite> layers. However, entropy minimization is often unstable, and many subsequent works <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib26" title="" class="ltx_ref">26</a>, <a href="#bib.bib27" title="" class="ltx_ref">27</a>, <a href="#bib.bib22" title="" class="ltx_ref">22</a>]</cite> focus on improving its robustness. One important variant is marginal entropy <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib43" title="" class="ltx_ref">43</a>]</cite>, which captures a model’s uncertainty across different augmentations of the same input. This idea has inspired several follow-up TTA approaches <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib35" title="" class="ltx_ref">35</a>, <a href="#bib.bib36" title="" class="ltx_ref">36</a>]</cite> for VLMs.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Another line of potential approaches focuses on restoring uncorrupted images from corrupted ones, using generative techniques such as diffusion models <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib13" title="" class="ltx_ref">13</a>]</cite> or super-resolution <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib30" title="" class="ltx_ref">30</a>, <a href="#bib.bib6" title="" class="ltx_ref">6</a>]</cite>. These methods do not require adapting the model at test time. However, as noted in <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib27" title="" class="ltx_ref">27</a>]</cite>, they often perform well on certain types of corruption but poorly on others, indicating limited generalization across corruption types.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>Limitations</h3>

<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">While our analysis reveals a consistent variance collapse pattern across multiple datasets and corruption types, it primarily focuses on natural distribution shifts and classification tasks. Extending our analysis and algorithm to broader types of distribution shifts (e.g., adversarial perturbations) and more diverse tasks (e.g., object detection, semantic segmentation) represents an important direction for future work.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>Broader impacts</h3>

<div id="A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Our work focuses on understanding and mitigating the degradation of vision-language models under distribution shift, particularly in the context of image corruption. On the positive side, improving model robustness can enhance the reliability of real-world applications such as accessibility tools, autonomous systems, and content moderation, especially under suboptimal conditions. By providing theoretical insights and simple, efficient test-time adaptation methods, our work contributes toward safer and more dependable AI deployments.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p2.1" class="ltx_p">We do not anticipate significant negative societal impacts. Our method is unsupervised, operates solely at test time, and does not require access to sensitive data or any form of user interaction. Nonetheless, as with all performance-enhancing techniques, there is potential for misuse in contexts where robustness could amplify existing biases or be deployed without appropriate oversight. We encourage future work to consider fairness and accountability as these methods are applied more broadly.</p>
</div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Theoretical analysis</h2>

<section id="A2.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.1 </span>Variance decomposition</h3>

<div id="A2.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section we give formal proof of variance decomposition.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.Thmtheorem1" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A2.Thmtheorem1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma B.1</span></span><span id="A2.Thmtheorem1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A2.Thmtheorem1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<table id="A2.EGx10" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.E11"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle{\mathcal{V}}^{\text{GT}}_{\text{total}}={\mathcal{V}}^{\text{GT}}_{\text{intra}}+{\mathcal{V}}^{\text{GT}}_{\text{inter}},\quad{\mathcal{V}}^{\text{PL}}_{\text{total}}={\mathcal{V}}^{\text{PL}}_{\text{intra}}+{\mathcal{V}}^{\text{PL}}_{\text{inter}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">total</mtext><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">GT</mtext></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">intra</mtext><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">GT</mtext></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">inter</mtext><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">GT</mtext></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">total</mtext><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">PL</mtext></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">intra</mtext><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">PL</mtext></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">inter</mtext><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">PL</mtext></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle{\mathcal{V}}^{\text{GT}}_{\text{total}}={\mathcal{V}}^{\text{GT}}_{\text{intra}}+{\mathcal{V}}^{\text{GT}}_{\text{inter}},\quad{\mathcal{V}}^{\text{PL}}_{\text{total}}={\mathcal{V}}^{\text{PL}}_{\text{intra}}+{\mathcal{V}}^{\text{PL}}_{\text{inter}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(11)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS1.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A2.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text">We define “prior” for each class <math id="A2.SS1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c=1,\cdots,C" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋯</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c=1,\cdots,C</annotation></semantics></math>:</span></p>
<table id="A2.EGx11" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.E12"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\bar{y}_{c}=\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^{N}y_{ic}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover></mstyle><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\bar{y}_{c}=\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^{N}y_{ic},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(12)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS1.p2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p2.2.1" class="ltx_text">The class means are</span></p>
<table id="A2.EGx12" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.E13"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\bar{\bm{z}}_{c}:=\frac{\sum_{i=1}^{N}y_{ic}\cdot{\bm{z}}_{i}}{\sum_{i=1}^{N}y_{ic}}=\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\frac{y_{ic}}{\bar{y}_{c}}\cdot{\bm{z}}_{i}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>:=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\bar{\bm{z}}_{c}:=\frac{\sum_{i=1}^{N}y_{ic}\cdot{\bm{z}}_{i}}{\sum_{i=1}^{N}y_{ic}}=\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\frac{y_{ic}}{\bar{y}_{c}}\cdot{\bm{z}}_{i}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(13)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS1.p2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p2.3.1" class="ltx_text">The global mean is</span></p>
<table id="A2.EGx13" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.E14"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\bar{\bm{z}}=\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^{N}{\bm{z}}_{i}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover></mstyle><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\bar{\bm{z}}=\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^{N}{\bm{z}}_{i}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(14)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS1.p2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p2.4.1" class="ltx_text">Notice that for all class <math id="A2.SS1.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c=1,\cdots,C" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋯</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c=1,\cdots,C</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</span></p>
<table id="A2.EGx14" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex1"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\frac{y_{ic}}{\bar{y}_{c}}({\bm{z}}_{i}-\bar{\bm{z}}_{c})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\frac{y_{ic}}{\bar{y}_{c}}({\bm{z}}_{i}-\bar{\bm{z}}_{c})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\left(\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\frac{y_{ic}}{\bar{y}_{c}}{\bm{z}}_{i}\right)-\left(\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\frac{y_{ic}}{\bar{y}_{c}}\bar{\bm{z}}_{c}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\left(\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\frac{y_{ic}}{\bar{y}_{c}}{\bm{z}}_{i}\right)-\left(\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\frac{y_{ic}}{\bar{y}_{c}}\bar{\bm{z}}_{c}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex2"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\bar{\bm{z}}_{c}-\left(\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\frac{y_{ic}}{\bar{y}_{c}}\bar{\bm{z}}_{c}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\bar{\bm{z}}_{c}-\left(\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\frac{y_{ic}}{\bar{y}_{c}}\bar{\bm{z}}_{c}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(definition of <math id="A2.Ex2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{\bm{z}}_{c}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{\bm{z}}_{c}</annotation></semantics></math>)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex3"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\bar{\bm{z}}_{c}-\bar{\bm{z}}_{c}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\bar{\bm{z}}_{c}-\bar{\bm{z}}_{c}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(definition of <math id="A2.Ex3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{y}_{c}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{y}_{c}</annotation></semantics></math>)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex4"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle={\bm{0}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mn>𝟎</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle={\bm{0}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS1.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text">Therefore,</span></p>
<table id="A2.EGx15" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex5"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle{\mathcal{V}}^{\text{GT}}_{\text{total}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><mtext>total</mtext><mtext>GT</mtext></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle{\mathcal{V}}^{\text{GT}}_{\text{total}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{N\cdot C}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\sum_{c=1}^{C}\frac{y_{ic}}{\bar{y}_{c}}\left\|{\bm{z}}_{i}-\bar{\bm{z}}\right\|_{2}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>C</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{N\cdot C}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\sum_{c=1}^{C}\frac{y_{ic}}{\bar{y}_{c}}\left\|{\bm{z}}_{i}-\bar{\bm{z}}\right\|_{2}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex6"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{N\cdot C}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\sum_{c=1}^{C}\frac{y_{ic}}{\bar{y}_{c}}\left\|{\bm{z}}_{i}-\bar{\bm{z}}_{c}+\bar{\bm{z}}_{c}-\bar{\bm{z}}\right\|_{2}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>C</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{N\cdot C}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\sum_{c=1}^{C}\frac{y_{ic}}{\bar{y}_{c}}\left\|{\bm{z}}_{i}-\bar{\bm{z}}_{c}+\bar{\bm{z}}_{c}-\bar{\bm{z}}\right\|_{2}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex7"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{N\cdot C}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\sum_{c=1}^{C}\frac{y_{ic}}{\bar{y}_{c}}\left(\left\|{\bm{z}}_{i}-\bar{\bm{z}}_{c}\right\|_{2}^{2}+\left\|\bar{\bm{z}}_{c}-\bar{\bm{z}}\right\|_{2}^{2}+2\left({\bm{z}}_{i}-\bar{\bm{z}}_{c}\right)^{\top}\left(\bar{\bm{z}}_{c}-\bar{\bm{z}}\right)\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>C</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{N\cdot C}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\sum_{c=1}^{C}\frac{y_{ic}}{\bar{y}_{c}}\left(\left\|{\bm{z}}_{i}-\bar{\bm{z}}_{c}\right\|_{2}^{2}+\left\|\bar{\bm{z}}_{c}-\bar{\bm{z}}\right\|_{2}^{2}+2\left({\bm{z}}_{i}-\bar{\bm{z}}_{c}\right)^{\top}\left(\bar{\bm{z}}_{c}-\bar{\bm{z}}\right)\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex8"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{N\cdot C}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\sum_{c=1}^{C}\frac{y_{ic}}{\bar{y}_{c}}\left\|{\bm{z}}_{i}-\bar{\bm{z}}_{c}\right\|_{2}^{2}+\frac{1}{N\cdot C}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\sum_{c=1}^{C}\frac{y_{ic}}{\bar{y}_{c}}\left\|\bar{\bm{z}}_{c}-\bar{\bm{z}}\right\|_{2}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>C</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>C</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{N\cdot C}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\sum_{c=1}^{C}\frac{y_{ic}}{\bar{y}_{c}}\left\|{\bm{z}}_{i}-\bar{\bm{z}}_{c}\right\|_{2}^{2}+\frac{1}{N\cdot C}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\sum_{c=1}^{C}\frac{y_{ic}}{\bar{y}_{c}}\left\|\bar{\bm{z}}_{c}-\bar{\bm{z}}\right\|_{2}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex9"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex9.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{N\cdot C}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\sum_{c=1}^{C}\frac{y_{ic}}{\bar{y}_{c}}\left\|{\bm{z}}_{i}-\bar{\bm{z}}_{c}\right\|_{2}^{2}+\frac{1}{C}\sum_{c=1}^{C}\left\|\bar{\bm{z}}_{c}-\bar{\bm{z}}\right\|_{2}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>C</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>C</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>C</mi></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{N\cdot C}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\sum_{c=1}^{C}\frac{y_{ic}}{\bar{y}_{c}}\left\|{\bm{z}}_{i}-\bar{\bm{z}}_{c}\right\|_{2}^{2}+\frac{1}{C}\sum_{c=1}^{C}\left\|\bar{\bm{z}}_{c}-\bar{\bm{z}}\right\|_{2}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(definition of <math id="A2.Ex9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{y}_{c}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{y}_{c}</annotation></semantics></math>)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex10"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle={\mathcal{V}}^{\text{GT}}_{\text{intra}}+{\mathcal{V}}^{\text{GT}}_{\text{inter}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><mtext>intra</mtext><mtext>GT</mtext></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><mtext>inter</mtext><mtext>GT</mtext></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle={\mathcal{V}}^{\text{GT}}_{\text{intra}}+{\mathcal{V}}^{\text{GT}}_{\text{inter}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS1.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS1.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text">By replacing each <math id="A2.SS1.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y_{ic}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y_{ic}</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="A2.SS1.p4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{y}_{ic}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{y}_{ic}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A2.SS1.p4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{{\bm{z}}}_{c}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{{\bm{z}}}_{c}</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="A2.SS1.p4.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{{\bm{z}}}_{c}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{{\bm{z}}}_{c}</annotation></semantics></math>, and <math id="A2.SS1.p4.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{{\bm{z}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{{\bm{z}}}</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="A2.SS1.p4.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{{\bm{z}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{{\bm{z}}}</annotation></semantics></math>, and repeating the above steps, it is straightforward to prove <math id="A2.SS1.p4.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathcal{V}}^{\text{PL}}_{\text{total}}={\mathcal{V}}^{\text{PL}}_{\text{intra}}+{\mathcal{V}}^{\text{PL}}_{\text{inter}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><mtext>total</mtext><mtext>PL</mtext></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><mtext>intra</mtext><mtext>PL</mtext></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><mtext>inter</mtext><mtext>PL</mtext></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathcal{V}}^{\text{PL}}_{\text{total}}={\mathcal{V}}^{\text{PL}}_{\text{intra}}+{\mathcal{V}}^{\text{PL}}_{\text{inter}}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS1.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS1.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text">∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.2 </span>Theoretical setup</h3>

<div id="A2.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This section introduces the setup and assumptions of our theoretical analysis. For simplicity, we focus on a binary classification setting where <math id="A2.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C=2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C=2</annotation></semantics></math>. While the standard notation of label for image <math id="A2.SS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math> is <math id="A2.SS2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{y}}_{i}=[y_{i0},y_{i1}]^{\top}\in\mathbb{R}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝒚</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{y}}_{i}=[y_{i0},y_{i1}]^{\top}\in\mathbb{R}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math>, we write <math id="A2.SS2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y_{i}=y_{i1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y_{i}=y_{i1}</annotation></semantics></math> for brevity, with a mild abuse of notation. We also assume there is no label imbalance, i.e., <math id="A2.SS2.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Pr(y_{i}=0)=\Pr(y_{1}=1)=\frac{1}{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>Pr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>Pr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Pr(y_{i}=0)=\Pr(y_{1}=1)=\frac{1}{2}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<section id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Image latent representation</h5>

<div id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Motivated by <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib39" title="" class="ltx_ref">39</a>]</cite>, we assume that each image can be mapped to a disentangled latent representation <math id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{v}}_{i}=[{\bm{v}}^{\text{cls}}_{i};{\bm{v}}^{\text{irr}}_{i};{\bm{v}}^{\text{shift}}_{i};{\bm{v}}^{\text{noise}}_{i}]\in\mathbb{R}^{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝒗</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝒗</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>cls</mtext></msubsup><mo>;</mo><msubsup><mi>𝒗</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msubsup><mo>;</mo><msubsup><mi>𝒗</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>shift</mtext></msubsup><mo>;</mo><msubsup><mi>𝒗</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{v}}_{i}=[{\bm{v}}^{\text{cls}}_{i};{\bm{v}}^{\text{irr}}_{i};{\bm{v}}^{\text{shift}}_{i};{\bm{v}}^{\text{noise}}_{i}]\in\mathbb{R}^{d}</annotation></semantics></math>, composed of four components:</p>
<ol id="A2.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="A2.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Class-relevant feature</span> <math id="A2.I1.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{v}}^{\text{cls}}_{i}\in\mathbb{R}^{d_{\text{cls}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝒗</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>cls</mtext></msubsup><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>cls</mtext></msub></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{v}}^{\text{cls}}_{i}\in\mathbb{R}^{d_{\text{cls}}}</annotation></semantics></math>:
Semantic feature that are directly predictive of the class label,
<math id="A2.I1.i1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{v}}^{\text{cls}}_{i}={\bm{\mu}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝒗</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>cls</mtext></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{v}}^{\text{cls}}_{i}={\bm{\mu}}</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="A2.I1.i1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y_{i}=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y_{i}=1</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A2.I1.i1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{v}}^{\text{cls}}_{i}=-{\bm{\mu}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝒗</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>cls</mtext></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{v}}^{\text{cls}}_{i}=-{\bm{\mu}}</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="A2.I1.i1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y_{i}=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y_{i}=0</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2.</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Class-irrelevant feature</span> <math id="A2.I1.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{v}}^{\text{irr}}_{i}\in\mathbb{R}^{d_{\text{irr}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝒗</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msubsup><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msub></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{v}}^{\text{irr}}_{i}\in\mathbb{R}^{d_{\text{irr}}}</annotation></semantics></math>:
Features that are unrelated to the classification task, such as background information. It is preserved during pretraining due to CLIP’s general representation learning objective. We assume <math id="A2.I1.i2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{v}}^{\text{irr}}_{i}\sim\text{Rademacher}^{d_{\text{irr}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝒗</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msubsup><mo>∼</mo><msup><mtext>Rademacher</mtext><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msub></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{v}}^{\text{irr}}_{i}\sim\text{Rademacher}^{d_{\text{irr}}}</annotation></semantics></math>, i.e., uniformly distributed in <math id="A2.I1.i2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{-1,1\}^{d_{\text{irr}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msub></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{-1,1\}^{d_{\text{irr}}}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">3.</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Structured distribution shift</span> <math id="A2.I1.i3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{v}}^{\text{shift}}_{i}\in\mathbb{R}^{d_{\text{shift}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝒗</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>shift</mtext></msubsup><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>shift</mtext></msub></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{v}}^{\text{shift}}_{i}\in\mathbb{R}^{d_{\text{shift}}}</annotation></semantics></math>:
Features representing systematic distribution changes in the target domain, such as weather conditions or digital transforms. We assume <math id="A2.I1.i3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{v}}^{\text{shift}}_{i}=s\cdot\bm{\delta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝒗</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>shift</mtext></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>𝜹</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{v}}^{\text{shift}}_{i}=s\cdot\bm{\delta}</annotation></semantics></math>, where <math id="A2.I1.i3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>s</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s</annotation></semantics></math> indicates the severity of corruption or distribution shift.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">4.</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.I1.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Unstructured noise</span> <math id="A2.I1.i4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{v}}^{\text{noise}}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>𝒗</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{v}}^{\text{noise}}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>:
Random noise introduced by the corruption process. We assume <math id="A2.I1.i4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{v}}^{\text{noise}}\sim s\cdot\text{Rademacher}^{d_{\text{noise}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>𝒗</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msup><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msup><mtext>Rademacher</mtext><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msub></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{v}}^{\text{noise}}\sim s\cdot\text{Rademacher}^{d_{\text{noise}}}</annotation></semantics></math>, i.e., uniformly distributed in <math id="A2.I1.i4.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{-1,1\}^{d_{\text{noise}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msub></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{-1,1\}^{d_{\text{noise}}}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Notice that by controlling the ratio of <math id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s,\|{\bm{\mu}}\|_{2},\|\bm{\delta}\|_{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝝁</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝜹</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s,\|{\bm{\mu}}\|_{2},\|\bm{\delta}\|_{2}</annotation></semantics></math>, we can freely adjust the ratio for four components.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">LayerNorm and image embedding</h5>

<div id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Following the structure of CLIP’s visual encoder, we assume that the latent representation <math id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{v}}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝒗</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{v}}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> first passes through a LayerNorm layer <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib2" title="" class="ltx_ref">2</a>]</cite> with linear transformation, and then normalized to unit length. For analytical simplicity, we omit the demeaning step LayerNorm and ignore the bias term in its parameters. This simplification is also known as RMSNorm <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib41" title="" class="ltx_ref">41</a>]</cite>. Under this simplification, the image embedding can be expressed as</p>
<table id="A2.EGx16" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.E15"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle{\bm{z}}_{i}=\mathrm{normalize}\left(\frac{{\bm{v}}_{i}}{\sqrt{\mathrm{Var}[{\bm{v}}_{i}]}}\odot{\bm{w}}\right)," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>normalize</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msub><mi>𝒗</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msqrt><mrow><mi>Var</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>𝒗</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><mi>𝒘</mi></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle{\bm{z}}_{i}=\mathrm{normalize}\left(\frac{{\bm{v}}_{i}}{\sqrt{\mathrm{Var}[{\bm{v}}_{i}]}}\odot{\bm{w}}\right),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(15)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\odot" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊙</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\odot</annotation></semantics></math> represents element-wise multiplication of vectors, <math id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{w}}=[{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}};{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}};{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}};{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}]\in\mathbb{R}^{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒘</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>cls</mtext></msup><mo>;</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msup><mo>;</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>shift</mtext></msup><mo>;</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{w}}=[{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}};{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}};{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}};{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}]\in\mathbb{R}^{d}</annotation></semantics></math> is the LayerNorm weights, and <math id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{normalize}(\cdot)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>normalize</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{normalize}(\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math> denotes <math id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell_{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell_{2}</annotation></semantics></math> normalization. For simplicity, we assume <math id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{w}}={\bm{1}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒘</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>𝟏</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{w}}={\bm{1}}</annotation></semantics></math> at initialization. <math id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{w}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝒘</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{w}}</annotation></semantics></math> is updated during TTA. Since <math id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sqrt{\mathrm{Var}[{\bm{v}}_{i}]}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msqrt><mrow><mi>Var</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>𝒗</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></msqrt><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sqrt{\mathrm{Var}[{\bm{v}}_{i}]}</annotation></semantics></math> is just a scalar, the equation above can be further reduced to</p>
<table id="A2.EGx17" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.E16"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle{\bm{z}}_{i}=\mathrm{normalize}\left({\bm{v}}_{i}\odot{\bm{w}}\right)=\frac{{\bm{v}}_{i}\odot{\bm{w}}}{\|{\bm{v}}_{i}\odot{\bm{w}}\|_{2}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>normalize</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒗</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><mi>𝒘</mi></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>𝒗</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><mi>𝒘</mi></mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒗</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><mi>𝒘</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle{\bm{z}}_{i}=\mathrm{normalize}\left({\bm{v}}_{i}\odot{\bm{w}}\right)=\frac{{\bm{v}}_{i}\odot{\bm{w}}}{\|{\bm{v}}_{i}\odot{\bm{w}}\|_{2}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(16)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Text embedding and prediction</h5>

<div id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Let <math id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{t}}_{0},{\bm{t}}_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝒕</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝒕</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{t}}_{0},{\bm{t}}_{1}</annotation></semantics></math> denotes the text embedding for class 0 and 1, respectively. The model prediction is given by</p>
<table id="A2.EGx18" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.E17"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle y_{i}=\begin{cases}0,&amp;\text{when }{\bm{z}}_{i}^{\top}{\bm{t}}_{0}\geq{\bm{z}}_{i}^{\top}{\bm{t}}_{1}\\
1,&amp;\text{when }{\bm{z}}_{i}^{\top}{\bm{t}}_{0}&lt;{\bm{z}}_{i}^{\top}{\bm{t}}_{1}\\
\end{cases}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mtext>when </mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒕</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒕</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mtext>when </mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒕</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒕</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle y_{i}=\begin{cases}0,&amp;\text{when }{\bm{z}}_{i}^{\top}{\bm{t}}_{0}\geq{\bm{z}}_{i}^{\top}{\bm{t}}_{1}\\
1,&amp;\text{when }{\bm{z}}_{i}^{\top}{\bm{t}}_{0}&lt;{\bm{z}}_{i}^{\top}{\bm{t}}_{1}\\
\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(17)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.3 </span>Change of variances under corruption</h3>

<div id="A2.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This section studies the behavior of various types of variance with increasing corruption severity <math id="A2.SS3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>s</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS3.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS3.p2.1" class="ltx_p">See <a href="#S3.Thmtheorem1" title="Theorem 3.1 (Variance collapse). ‣ 3.2 Theoretical explanation ‣ 3 Analysis ‣ Mint: A Simple Test-Time Adaptation of Vision-Language Models against Common Corruptions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.1</span></a></p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS3.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A2.SS3.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS3.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS3.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text">We first compute the normalizing factor for each image:</span></p>
<table id="A2.EGx19" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex11"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\|{\bm{v}}_{i}\odot{\bm{w}}\|_{2}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒗</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><mi>𝒘</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\|{\bm{v}}_{i}\odot{\bm{w}}\|_{2}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\|{\bm{v}}^{\text{cls}}_{i}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}\|_{2}^{2}+\|{\bm{v}}^{\text{irr}}_{i}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}\|_{2}^{2}+\|{\bm{v}}^{\text{shift}}_{i}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}}\|_{2}^{2}+\|{\bm{v}}^{\text{noise}}_{i}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}\|_{2}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝒗</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>cls</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>cls</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝒗</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝒗</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>shift</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>shift</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝒗</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\|{\bm{v}}^{\text{cls}}_{i}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}\|_{2}^{2}+\|{\bm{v}}^{\text{irr}}_{i}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}\|_{2}^{2}+\|{\bm{v}}^{\text{shift}}_{i}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}}\|_{2}^{2}+\|{\bm{v}}^{\text{noise}}_{i}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}\|_{2}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex12"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\|{\bm{\mu}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}\|_{2}^{2}+\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}\|_{2}^{2}+s^{2}\cdot\|\bm{\delta}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}}\|_{2}^{2}+s^{2}\cdot\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}\|_{2}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>𝝁</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>cls</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>𝜹</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>shift</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\|{\bm{\mu}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}\|_{2}^{2}+\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}\|_{2}^{2}+s^{2}\cdot\|\bm{\delta}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}}\|_{2}^{2}+s^{2}\cdot\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}\|_{2}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex13"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex13.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\|{\bm{\mu}}\|_{2}^{2}+d_{\text{irr}}+s^{2}\cdot(\|\bm{\delta}\|_{2}^{2}+d_{\text{noise}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝝁</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝜹</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\|{\bm{\mu}}\|_{2}^{2}+d_{\text{irr}}+s^{2}\cdot(\|\bm{\delta}\|_{2}^{2}+d_{\text{noise}})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(at initialization <math id="A2.Ex13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{w}}={\bm{1}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒘</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>𝟏</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{w}}={\bm{1}}</annotation></semantics></math>)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS3.p3.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS3.p3.2.1" class="ltx_text">Notice that this normalizing factor is the same for each image, and is a function of <math id="A2.SS3.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{w}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝒘</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{w}}</annotation></semantics></math> and severity <math id="A2.SS3.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>s</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s</annotation></semantics></math>. Let</span></p>
<table id="A2.EGx20" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex14"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle Z({\bm{w}},s)=\sqrt{\|{\bm{\mu}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}\|_{2}^{2}+\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}\|_{2}^{2}+s^{2}\cdot\|\bm{\delta}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}}\|_{2}^{2}+s^{2}\cdot\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}\|_{2}^{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒘</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>𝝁</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>cls</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>𝜹</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>shift</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle Z({\bm{w}},s)=\sqrt{\|{\bm{\mu}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}\|_{2}^{2}+\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}\|_{2}^{2}+s^{2}\cdot\|\bm{\delta}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}}\|_{2}^{2}+s^{2}\cdot\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}\|_{2}^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS3.p3.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS3.p3.3.1" class="ltx_text">denote the normalizing factor. Under infinite sample size, the total mean <math id="A2.SS3.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{{\bm{z}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{{\bm{z}}}</annotation></semantics></math> and class means <math id="A2.SS3.p3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{{\bm{z}}}_{0},\bar{{\bm{z}}}_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{{\bm{z}}}_{0},\bar{{\bm{z}}}_{1}</annotation></semantics></math> can be expressed as:</span></p>
<table id="A2.EGx21" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex15"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\bar{{\bm{z}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\bar{{\bm{z}}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex15.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\xrightarrow{p}\mathbb{E}{\bm{z}}_{i}=\frac{1}{Z({\bm{w}},s)}\cdot[{\bm{0}};{\bm{0}};s\cdot\bm{\delta}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}};{\bm{0}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mover accent="true"><mo>→</mo><mo mathsize="0.700em">𝑝</mo></mover><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒘</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>𝟎</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>𝟎</mn><mo>;</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>𝜹</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>shift</mtext></msup></mrow><mo>;</mo><mn>𝟎</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\xrightarrow{p}\mathbb{E}{\bm{z}}_{i}=\frac{1}{Z({\bm{w}},s)}\cdot[{\bm{0}};{\bm{0}};s\cdot\bm{\delta}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}};{\bm{0}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex16"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\bar{{\bm{z}}}_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>0</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\bar{{\bm{z}}}_{0}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex16.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\xrightarrow{p}\mathbb{E}[{\bm{z}}_{i}|y_{i}=0]=\frac{1}{Z({\bm{w}},s)}\cdot[{\bm{\mu}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}};{\bm{0}};s\cdot\bm{\delta}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}};{\bm{0}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mover accent="true"><mo>→</mo><mo mathsize="0.700em">𝑝</mo></mover><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒘</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝝁</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>cls</mtext></msup></mrow><mo>;</mo><mn>𝟎</mn><mo>;</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>𝜹</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>shift</mtext></msup></mrow><mo>;</mo><mn>𝟎</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\xrightarrow{p}\mathbb{E}[{\bm{z}}_{i}|y_{i}=0]=\frac{1}{Z({\bm{w}},s)}\cdot[{\bm{\mu}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}};{\bm{0}};s\cdot\bm{\delta}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}};{\bm{0}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex17"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\bar{{\bm{z}}}_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\bar{{\bm{z}}}_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex17.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\xrightarrow{p}\mathbb{E}[{\bm{z}}_{i}|y_{i}=1]=\frac{1}{Z({\bm{w}},s)}\cdot[-{\bm{\mu}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}};{\bm{0}};s\cdot\bm{\delta}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}};{\bm{0}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mo>→</mo><mo mathsize="0.700em">𝑝</mo></mover><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒘</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mi>𝝁</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>cls</mtext></msup><mo>;</mo><mn>𝟎</mn><mo>;</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>𝜹</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>shift</mtext></msup><mo>;</mo><mn>𝟎</mn><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\xrightarrow{p}\mathbb{E}[{\bm{z}}_{i}|y_{i}=1]=\frac{1}{Z({\bm{w}},s)}\cdot[-{\bm{\mu}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}};{\bm{0}};s\cdot\bm{\delta}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}};{\bm{0}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS3.p3.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS3.p3.4.1" class="ltx_text">The GT-total variance:</span></p>
<table id="A2.EGx22" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex18"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle{\mathcal{V}}^{\text{GT}}_{\text{total}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><mtext>total</mtext><mtext>GT</mtext></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle{\mathcal{V}}^{\text{GT}}_{\text{total}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex18.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\xrightarrow{p}\mathbb{E}\|{\bm{z}}_{i}-\mathbb{E}{\bm{z}}_{i}\|_{2}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mover accent="true"><mo>→</mo><mo mathsize="0.700em">𝑝</mo></mover><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\xrightarrow{p}\mathbb{E}\|{\bm{z}}_{i}-\mathbb{E}{\bm{z}}_{i}\|_{2}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex19"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{Z({\bm{w}},s)^{2}}\cdot\left(\|{\bm{\mu}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}\|_{2}^{2}+\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}\|_{2}^{2}+0+\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}\|_{2}^{2}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒘</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>𝝁</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>cls</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{Z({\bm{w}},s)^{2}}\cdot\left(\|{\bm{\mu}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}\|_{2}^{2}+\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}\|_{2}^{2}+0+\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}\|_{2}^{2}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex20"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex20.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{\|{\bm{\mu}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}\|_{2}^{2}+\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}\|_{2}^{2}+s^{2}\cdot\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}\|_{2}^{2}}{\|{\bm{\mu}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}\|_{2}^{2}+\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}\|_{2}^{2}+s^{2}\cdot\|\bm{\delta}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}}\|_{2}^{2}+s^{2}\cdot\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}\|_{2}^{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>𝝁</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>cls</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>𝝁</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>cls</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>𝜹</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>shift</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{\|{\bm{\mu}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}\|_{2}^{2}+\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}\|_{2}^{2}+s^{2}\cdot\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}\|_{2}^{2}}{\|{\bm{\mu}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}\|_{2}^{2}+\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}\|_{2}^{2}+s^{2}\cdot\|\bm{\delta}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}}\|_{2}^{2}+s^{2}\cdot\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}\|_{2}^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex21"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex21.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{\|{\bm{\mu}}\|_{2}^{2}+d_{\text{irr}}+s^{2}\cdot d_{\text{noise}}}{\|{\bm{\mu}}\|_{2}^{2}+d_{\text{irr}}+s^{2}\cdot(\|\bm{\delta}\|_{2}^{2}+d_{\text{noise}})}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝝁</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msub></mrow></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝝁</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝜹</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{\|{\bm{\mu}}\|_{2}^{2}+d_{\text{irr}}+s^{2}\cdot d_{\text{noise}}}{\|{\bm{\mu}}\|_{2}^{2}+d_{\text{irr}}+s^{2}\cdot(\|\bm{\delta}\|_{2}^{2}+d_{\text{noise}})}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(at initialization <math id="A2.Ex21.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{w}}={\bm{1}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒘</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>𝟏</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{w}}={\bm{1}}</annotation></semantics></math>)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS3.p3.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS3.p3.5.1" class="ltx_text">The GT-inter variance:</span></p>
<table id="A2.EGx23" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex22"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex22.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle{\mathcal{V}}^{\text{GT}}_{\text{inter}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><mtext>inter</mtext><mtext>GT</mtext></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle{\mathcal{V}}^{\text{GT}}_{\text{inter}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex22.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\xrightarrow{p}\frac{1}{2}\sum_{c=1}^{2}\left\|\mathbb{E}[{\bm{z}}_{i}|y_{i}=c]-\mathbb{E}{\bm{z}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mover accent="true"><mo>→</mo><mo mathsize="0.700em">𝑝</mo></mover><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\xrightarrow{p}\frac{1}{2}\sum_{c=1}^{2}\left\|\mathbb{E}[{\bm{z}}_{i}|y_{i}=c]-\mathbb{E}{\bm{z}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex23"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex23.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{Z({\bm{w}},s)^{2}}\cdot\|{\bm{\mu}}\|_{2}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒘</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝝁</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{Z({\bm{w}},s)^{2}}\cdot\|{\bm{\mu}}\|_{2}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex24"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex24.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{\|{\bm{\mu}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}\|_{2}^{2}}{\|{\bm{\mu}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}\|_{2}^{2}+\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}\|_{2}^{2}+s^{2}\cdot\|\bm{\delta}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}}\|_{2}^{2}+s^{2}\cdot\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}\|_{2}^{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>𝝁</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>cls</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>𝝁</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>cls</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>𝜹</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>shift</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{\|{\bm{\mu}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}\|_{2}^{2}}{\|{\bm{\mu}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}\|_{2}^{2}+\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}\|_{2}^{2}+s^{2}\cdot\|\bm{\delta}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}}\|_{2}^{2}+s^{2}\cdot\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}\|_{2}^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex25"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex25.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{\|{\bm{\mu}}\|_{2}^{2}}{\|{\bm{\mu}}\|_{2}^{2}+d_{\text{irr}}+s^{2}\cdot(\|\bm{\delta}\|_{2}^{2}+d_{\text{noise}})}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝝁</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝝁</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝜹</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{\|{\bm{\mu}}\|_{2}^{2}}{\|{\bm{\mu}}\|_{2}^{2}+d_{\text{irr}}+s^{2}\cdot(\|\bm{\delta}\|_{2}^{2}+d_{\text{noise}})}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(at initialization <math id="A2.Ex25.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{w}}={\bm{1}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒘</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>𝟏</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{w}}={\bm{1}}</annotation></semantics></math>)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS3.p3.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS3.p3.6.1" class="ltx_text">And the GT-intra variance:</span></p>
<table id="A2.EGx24" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex26"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex26.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle{\mathcal{V}}^{\text{GT}}_{\text{intra}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><mtext>intra</mtext><mtext>GT</mtext></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle{\mathcal{V}}^{\text{GT}}_{\text{intra}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex26.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle={\mathcal{V}}^{\text{GT}}_{\text{total}}-{\mathcal{V}}^{\text{GT}}_{\text{inter}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><mtext>total</mtext><mtext>GT</mtext></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><mtext>inter</mtext><mtext>GT</mtext></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle={\mathcal{V}}^{\text{GT}}_{\text{total}}-{\mathcal{V}}^{\text{GT}}_{\text{inter}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex27"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex27.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\xrightarrow{p}\frac{\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}\|_{2}^{2}+s^{2}\cdot\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}\|_{2}^{2}}{\|{\bm{\mu}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}\|_{2}^{2}+\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}\|_{2}^{2}+s^{2}\cdot\|\bm{\delta}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}}\|_{2}^{2}+s^{2}\cdot\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}\|_{2}^{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mover accent="true"><mo>→</mo><mo mathsize="0.700em">𝑝</mo></mover><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>𝝁</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>cls</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>𝜹</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>shift</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\xrightarrow{p}\frac{\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}\|_{2}^{2}+s^{2}\cdot\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}\|_{2}^{2}}{\|{\bm{\mu}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}\|_{2}^{2}+\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}\|_{2}^{2}+s^{2}\cdot\|\bm{\delta}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}}\|_{2}^{2}+s^{2}\cdot\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}\|_{2}^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex28"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex28.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{d_{\text{irr}}+s^{2}\cdot d_{\text{noise}}}{\|{\bm{\mu}}\|_{2}^{2}+d_{\text{irr}}+s^{2}\cdot(\|\bm{\delta}\|_{2}^{2}+d_{\text{noise}})}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msub></mrow></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝝁</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝜹</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{d_{\text{irr}}+s^{2}\cdot d_{\text{noise}}}{\|{\bm{\mu}}\|_{2}^{2}+d_{\text{irr}}+s^{2}\cdot(\|\bm{\delta}\|_{2}^{2}+d_{\text{noise}})}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(at initialization <math id="A2.Ex28.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{w}}={\bm{1}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒘</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>𝟏</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{w}}={\bm{1}}</annotation></semantics></math>)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS3.p3.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS3.p3.7.1" class="ltx_text">∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.4 </span>Adaptation</h3>

<div id="A2.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, we derive how maximizing the pseudo-label inter-class (PL-inter) variance influences the learned representation, when only the LayerNorm parameters are updated during test-time adaptation.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.Thmtheorem2" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A2.Thmtheorem2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma B.2</span></span><span id="A2.Thmtheorem2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A2.Thmtheorem2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.Thmtheorem2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.Thmtheorem2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">When the sample size <math id="A2.Thmtheorem2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N\to+\infty" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mrow><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N\to+\infty</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
<table id="A2.EGx25" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex29"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex29.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle{\mathcal{V}}^{\text{PL}}_{\text{inter}}\xrightarrow{p}\frac{1}{2}\left(\frac{1}{(\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i})^{2}}+\frac{1}{(1-\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i})^{2}}\right)\cdot\|\mathrm{Cov}({\bm{z}}_{i},\hat{y}_{i})\|_{2}^{2}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">inter</mtext><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">PL</mtext></msubsup><mover accent="true"><mo>→</mo><mo mathsize="0.700em">𝑝</mo></mover><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>Cov</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle{\mathcal{V}}^{\text{PL}}_{\text{inter}}\xrightarrow{p}\frac{1}{2}\left(\frac{1}{(\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i})^{2}}+\frac{1}{(1-\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i})^{2}}\right)\cdot\|\mathrm{Cov}({\bm{z}}_{i},\hat{y}_{i})\|_{2}^{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS4.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A2.SS4.p2" class="ltx_para">
<table id="A2.EGx26" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex30"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex30.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[{\bm{z}}_{i}|\hat{y}_{i}=1]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[{\bm{z}}_{i}|\hat{y}_{i}=1]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex30.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{\mathbb{E}[\hat{y}_{i}\cdot{\bm{z}}_{i}]}{\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i}}=\frac{\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i}\cdot\mathbb{E}{\bm{z}}_{i}+\mathrm{Cov}({\bm{z}}_{i},\hat{y}_{i})}{\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i}}=\mathbb{E}{\bm{z}}_{i}+\frac{\mathrm{Cov}({\bm{z}}_{i},\hat{y}_{i})}{\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>𝔼</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>Cov</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>Cov</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{\mathbb{E}[\hat{y}_{i}\cdot{\bm{z}}_{i}]}{\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i}}=\frac{\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i}\cdot\mathbb{E}{\bm{z}}_{i}+\mathrm{Cov}({\bm{z}}_{i},\hat{y}_{i})}{\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i}}=\mathbb{E}{\bm{z}}_{i}+\frac{\mathrm{Cov}({\bm{z}}_{i},\hat{y}_{i})}{\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex31"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex31.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[{\bm{z}}_{i}|\hat{y}_{i}=0]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[{\bm{z}}_{i}|\hat{y}_{i}=0]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex31.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}{\bm{z}}_{i}-\frac{\mathrm{Cov}({\bm{z}}_{i},\hat{y}_{i})}{1-\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>Cov</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}{\bm{z}}_{i}-\frac{\mathrm{Cov}({\bm{z}}_{i},\hat{y}_{i})}{1-\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex32"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex32.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle{\mathcal{V}}^{\text{PL}}_{\text{inter}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><mtext>inter</mtext><mtext>PL</mtext></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle{\mathcal{V}}^{\text{PL}}_{\text{inter}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex32.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\xrightarrow{p}\frac{1}{2}\sum_{c=1}^{2}\left\|\mathbb{E}[{\bm{z}}_{i}|\hat{y}_{i}=c]-\mathbb{E}{\bm{z}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}=\frac{1}{2}\left(\frac{1}{(\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i})^{2}}+\frac{1}{(1-\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i})^{2}}\right)\cdot\|\mathrm{Cov}({\bm{z}}_{i},\hat{y}_{i})\|_{2}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mover accent="true"><mo>→</mo><mo mathsize="0.700em">𝑝</mo></mover><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>Cov</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\xrightarrow{p}\frac{1}{2}\sum_{c=1}^{2}\left\|\mathbb{E}[{\bm{z}}_{i}|\hat{y}_{i}=c]-\mathbb{E}{\bm{z}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}=\frac{1}{2}\left(\frac{1}{(\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i})^{2}}+\frac{1}{(1-\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i})^{2}}\right)\cdot\|\mathrm{Cov}({\bm{z}}_{i},\hat{y}_{i})\|_{2}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS4.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS4.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS4.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text">∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A2.Thmtheorem3" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_remark">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A2.Thmtheorem3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Remark B.3</span></span><span id="A2.Thmtheorem3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">.</span></h6>
<div id="A2.Thmtheorem3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<table id="A2.EGx27" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex33"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex33.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathrm{Cov}({\bm{z}}_{i},\hat{y}_{i})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>Cov</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathrm{Cov}({\bm{z}}_{i},\hat{y}_{i})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex33.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sim\mathrm{Cov}({\bm{z}}_{i},{\bm{z}}_{i}^{\top}({\bm{t}}_{1}-{\bm{t}}_{0}))=\Sigma_{{\bm{z}}_{i}}({\bm{t}}_{1}-{\bm{t}}_{0})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi>Cov</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒕</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝒕</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒕</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝒕</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sim\mathrm{Cov}({\bm{z}}_{i},{\bm{z}}_{i}^{\top}({\bm{t}}_{1}-{\bm{t}}_{0}))=\Sigma_{{\bm{z}}_{i}}({\bm{t}}_{1}-{\bm{t}}_{0})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.Thmtheorem3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A2.Thmtheorem3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Sigma_{{\bm{z}}_{i}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Sigma_{{\bm{z}}_{i}}</annotation></semantics></math> is the covariance matrix of <math id="A2.Thmtheorem3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{z}}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{z}}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A2.Thmtheorem3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{t}}_{0},{\bm{t}}_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝒕</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝒕</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{t}}_{0},{\bm{t}}_{1}</annotation></semantics></math> are the text embedding of class 0 and 1. This implies that maximizing PL-inter will enhance those features that (1) have high variance, and (2) are more relevant to the classification task described by the text embedding.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS4.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS4.p4.1" class="ltx_p">See <a href="#S3.Thmtheorem2" title="Theorem 3.2 (Maximization of PL-inter variance). ‣ 3.3 Maximization of inter variance ‣ 3 Analysis ‣ Mint: A Simple Test-Time Adaptation of Vision-Language Models against Common Corruptions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.2</span></a></p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS4.3" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A2.SS4.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS4.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS4.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text">Similar to the procedure of deriving GT-inter, we start by computing the total mean <math id="A2.SS4.p5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{\bm{z}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{\bm{z}}</annotation></semantics></math> and pseudo-class means <math id="A2.SS4.p5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{\bm{z}}_{0},\tilde{\bm{z}}_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{\bm{z}}_{0},\tilde{\bm{z}}_{1}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
<table id="A2.EGx28" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex34"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex34.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\tilde{\bm{z}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\tilde{\bm{z}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex34.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\xrightarrow{p}\mathbb{E}{\bm{z}}_{i}=\frac{1}{Z({\bm{w}},s)}\cdot[{\bm{0}};{\bm{0}};s\cdot\bm{\delta}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}};{\bm{0}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mover accent="true"><mo>→</mo><mo mathsize="0.700em">𝑝</mo></mover><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒘</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>𝟎</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>𝟎</mn><mo>;</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>𝜹</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>shift</mtext></msup></mrow><mo>;</mo><mn>𝟎</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\xrightarrow{p}\mathbb{E}{\bm{z}}_{i}=\frac{1}{Z({\bm{w}},s)}\cdot[{\bm{0}};{\bm{0}};s\cdot\bm{\delta}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}};{\bm{0}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex35"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex35.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\tilde{{\bm{z}}}_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\tilde{{\bm{z}}}_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex35.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\xrightarrow{p}\mathbb{E}[{\bm{z}}_{i}|\hat{y}_{i}=1]=\frac{1}{\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i}}\cdot\frac{1}{Z({\bm{w}},s)}\cdot\mathbb{E}[\hat{y}_{i}\cdot{\bm{v}}_{i}\odot{\bm{w}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mover accent="true"><mo>→</mo><mo mathsize="0.700em">𝑝</mo></mover><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒘</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>𝒗</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><mi>𝒘</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\xrightarrow{p}\mathbb{E}[{\bm{z}}_{i}|\hat{y}_{i}=1]=\frac{1}{\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i}}\cdot\frac{1}{Z({\bm{w}},s)}\cdot\mathbb{E}[\hat{y}_{i}\cdot{\bm{v}}_{i}\odot{\bm{w}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex36"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex36.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\tilde{{\bm{z}}}_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒛</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mn>0</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\tilde{{\bm{z}}}_{0}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex36.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\xrightarrow{p}\mathbb{E}[{\bm{z}}_{i}|\hat{y}_{i}=0]=\frac{1}{1-\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i}}\cdot\frac{1}{Z({\bm{w}},s)}\cdot\mathbb{E}[(1-\hat{y}_{i})\cdot{\bm{v}}_{i}\odot{\bm{w}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mover accent="true"><mo>→</mo><mo mathsize="0.700em">𝑝</mo></mover><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒘</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>𝒗</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><mi>𝒘</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\xrightarrow{p}\mathbb{E}[{\bm{z}}_{i}|\hat{y}_{i}=0]=\frac{1}{1-\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i}}\cdot\frac{1}{Z({\bm{w}},s)}\cdot\mathbb{E}[(1-\hat{y}_{i})\cdot{\bm{v}}_{i}\odot{\bm{w}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS4.p5.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS4.p5.2.1" class="ltx_text">where <math id="A2.SS4.p5.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Z({\bm{w}},s)=\sqrt{\|{\bm{\mu}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}\|_{2}^{2}+\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}\|_{2}^{2}+s^{2}\cdot\|\bm{\delta}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}}\|_{2}^{2}+s^{2}\cdot\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}\|_{2}^{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒘</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>𝝁</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>cls</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>𝜹</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>shift</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z({\bm{w}},s)=\sqrt{\|{\bm{\mu}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}\|_{2}^{2}+\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}\|_{2}^{2}+s^{2}\cdot\|\bm{\delta}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}}\|_{2}^{2}+s^{2}\cdot\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}\|_{2}^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math> is the normalizing factor we defined in the proof of Theorem <a href="#S3.Thmtheorem1" title="Theorem 3.1 (Variance collapse). ‣ 3.2 Theoretical explanation ‣ 3 Analysis ‣ Mint: A Simple Test-Time Adaptation of Vision-Language Models against Common Corruptions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.1</span></a>. For four components of the feature:</span></p>
<table id="A2.EGx29" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex37"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex37.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[\hat{y}_{i}\cdot{\bm{v}}^{\text{cls}}_{i}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>𝒗</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>cls</mtext></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>cls</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[\hat{y}_{i}\cdot{\bm{v}}^{\text{cls}}_{i}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex37.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}[\hat{y}_{i}\cdot(2y_{i}-1)\cdot{\bm{\mu}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}]=2\mathrm{Cov}(\hat{y}_{i},y_{i})\cdot{\bm{\mu}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>cls</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>C</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>v</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>cls</mtext></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}[\hat{y}_{i}\cdot(2y_{i}-1)\cdot{\bm{\mu}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}]=2\mathrm{Cov}(\hat{y}_{i},y_{i})\cdot{\bm{\mu}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex38"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex38.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[\hat{y}_{i}\cdot{\bm{v}}^{\text{irr}}_{i}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>𝒗</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[\hat{y}_{i}\cdot{\bm{v}}^{\text{irr}}_{i}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex38.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathrm{Cov}(\hat{y}_{i},{\bm{v}}^{\text{irr}})\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>Cov</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝒗</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msup><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathrm{Cov}(\hat{y}_{i},{\bm{v}}^{\text{irr}})\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex39"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex39.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[\hat{y}_{i}\cdot{\bm{v}}^{\text{shift}}_{i}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>𝒗</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>shift</mtext></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>shift</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[\hat{y}_{i}\cdot{\bm{v}}^{\text{shift}}_{i}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex39.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i}\cdot s\cdot\bm{\delta}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>𝜹</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>shift</mtext></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i}\cdot s\cdot\bm{\delta}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex40"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex40.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[\hat{y}_{i}\cdot{\bm{v}}^{\text{noise}}_{i}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>𝒗</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[\hat{y}_{i}\cdot{\bm{v}}^{\text{noise}}_{i}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex40.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathrm{Cov}(\hat{y}_{i},{\bm{v}}^{\text{noise}})\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>Cov</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝒗</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msup><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathrm{Cov}(\hat{y}_{i},{\bm{v}}^{\text{noise}})\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS4.p5.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS4.p5.3.1" class="ltx_text">And similarly,</span></p>
<table id="A2.EGx30" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex41"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex41.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[(1-\hat{y}_{i})\cdot{\bm{v}}^{\text{cls}}_{i}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>𝒗</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>cls</mtext></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>cls</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[(1-\hat{y}_{i})\cdot{\bm{v}}^{\text{cls}}_{i}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex41.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}[(1-\hat{y}_{i})\cdot(2y_{i}-1)\cdot{\bm{\mu}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}]=-2\mathrm{Cov}(\hat{y}_{i},y_{i})\cdot{\bm{\mu}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>𝝁</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>cls</mtext></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>v</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>𝝁</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>cls</mtext></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}[(1-\hat{y}_{i})\cdot(2y_{i}-1)\cdot{\bm{\mu}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}]=-2\mathrm{Cov}(\hat{y}_{i},y_{i})\cdot{\bm{\mu}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex42"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex42.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[(1-\hat{y}_{i})\cdot{\bm{v}}^{\text{irr}}_{i}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>𝒗</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[(1-\hat{y}_{i})\cdot{\bm{v}}^{\text{irr}}_{i}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex42.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=-\mathrm{Cov}(\hat{y}_{i},{\bm{v}}^{\text{irr}})\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mi>Cov</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝒗</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msup><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=-\mathrm{Cov}(\hat{y}_{i},{\bm{v}}^{\text{irr}})\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex43"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex43.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[(1-\hat{y}_{i})\cdot{\bm{v}}^{\text{shift}}_{i}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>𝒗</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>shift</mtext></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>shift</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[(1-\hat{y}_{i})\cdot{\bm{v}}^{\text{shift}}_{i}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex43.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}(1-\hat{y}_{i})\cdot s\cdot\bm{\delta}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>𝜹</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>shift</mtext></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}(1-\hat{y}_{i})\cdot s\cdot\bm{\delta}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex44"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex44.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[(1-\hat{y}_{i})\cdot{\bm{v}}^{\text{noise}}_{i}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>𝒗</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[(1-\hat{y}_{i})\cdot{\bm{v}}^{\text{noise}}_{i}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex44.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=-\mathrm{Cov}(\hat{y}_{i},{\bm{v}}^{\text{noise}})\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mi>Cov</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝒗</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msup><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=-\mathrm{Cov}(\hat{y}_{i},{\bm{v}}^{\text{noise}})\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS4.p5.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS4.p5.4.1" class="ltx_text">Therefore, we have</span></p>
<table id="A2.EGx31" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex45"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex45.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle{\mathcal{V}}^{\text{PL}}_{\text{inter}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><mtext>inter</mtext><mtext>PL</mtext></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle{\mathcal{V}}^{\text{PL}}_{\text{inter}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex45.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\xrightarrow{p}\frac{1}{2}\sum_{c=1}^{2}\left\|\mathbb{E}[{\bm{z}}_{i}|\hat{y}_{i}=c]-\mathbb{E}{\bm{z}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mover accent="true"><mo>→</mo><mo mathsize="0.700em">𝑝</mo></mover><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒛</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\xrightarrow{p}\frac{1}{2}\sum_{c=1}^{2}\left\|\mathbb{E}[{\bm{z}}_{i}|\hat{y}_{i}=c]-\mathbb{E}{\bm{z}}_{i}\right\|_{2}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex46"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex46.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{2}\cdot\left(\frac{1}{(\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i})^{2}}+\frac{1}{(1-\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i})^{2}}\right)\cdot\frac{1}{Z({\bm{w}},s)^{2}}\cdot" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo rspace="0.055em">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒘</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.222em">⋅</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{2}\cdot\left(\frac{1}{(\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i})^{2}}+\frac{1}{(1-\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i})^{2}}\right)\cdot\frac{1}{Z({\bm{w}},s)^{2}}\cdot</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex47"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex47.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\quad\ \left(4\mathrm{Cov}(\hat{y}_{i},y)^{2}\cdot\|{\bm{\mu}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}\|_{2}^{2}+\|\mathrm{Cov}(\hat{y}_{i},{\bm{v}}^{\text{irr}})\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}\|_{2}^{2}+\|\mathrm{Cov}(\hat{y}_{i},{\bm{v}}^{\text{noise}})\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}\|_{2}^{2}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>C</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>v</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>𝝁</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>cls</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>Cov</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝒗</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msup><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>Cov</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝒗</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msup><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad\ \left(4\mathrm{Cov}(\hat{y}_{i},y)^{2}\cdot\|{\bm{\mu}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}\|_{2}^{2}+\|\mathrm{Cov}(\hat{y}_{i},{\bm{v}}^{\text{irr}})\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}\|_{2}^{2}+\|\mathrm{Cov}(\hat{y}_{i},{\bm{v}}^{\text{noise}})\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}\|_{2}^{2}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex48"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex48.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{2}\cdot\left(\frac{1}{(\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i})^{2}}+\frac{1}{(1-\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i})^{2}}\right)\cdot\frac{4\sigma_{\hat{y}y}^{2}\cdot\|{\bm{\mu}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}\|_{2}^{2}+\|\bm{\sigma}_{\text{irr}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}\|_{2}^{2}+\|\bm{\sigma}_{\text{noise}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}\|_{2}^{2}}{\|{\bm{\mu}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}\|_{2}^{2}+\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}\|_{2}^{2}+s^{2}\cdot\|\bm{\delta}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}}\|_{2}^{2}+s^{2}\cdot\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}\|_{2}^{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>𝝁</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>cls</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝝈</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝝈</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>𝝁</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>cls</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>𝜹</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>shift</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{2}\cdot\left(\frac{1}{(\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i})^{2}}+\frac{1}{(1-\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i})^{2}}\right)\cdot\frac{4\sigma_{\hat{y}y}^{2}\cdot\|{\bm{\mu}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}\|_{2}^{2}+\|\bm{\sigma}_{\text{irr}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}\|_{2}^{2}+\|\bm{\sigma}_{\text{noise}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}\|_{2}^{2}}{\|{\bm{\mu}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}\|_{2}^{2}+\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}\|_{2}^{2}+s^{2}\cdot\|\bm{\delta}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}}\|_{2}^{2}+s^{2}\cdot\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}\|_{2}^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS4.p5.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS4.p5.5.1" class="ltx_text">As a simple correctness check, when the pseudo-label <math id="A2.SS4.p5.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{y}_{i}=y_{i},\forall i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{y}_{i}=y_{i},\forall i</annotation></semantics></math>, substituting <math id="A2.SS4.p5.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i}=\mathbb{E}y_{i}=\frac{1}{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i}=\mathbb{E}y_{i}=\frac{1}{2}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A2.SS4.p5.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma_{\hat{y}y}=\mathrm{Var}(y_{i})=\frac{1}{4}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>Var</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma_{\hat{y}y}=\mathrm{Var}(y_{i})=\frac{1}{4}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A2.SS4.p5.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{\sigma}_{\text{irr}}={\bm{0}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝝈</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>𝟎</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{\sigma}_{\text{irr}}={\bm{0}}</annotation></semantics></math>, and <math id="A2.SS4.p5.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{\sigma}_{\text{noise}}={\bm{0}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝝈</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>𝟎</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{\sigma}_{\text{noise}}={\bm{0}}</annotation></semantics></math> recovers the result of GT-inter variance <math id="A2.SS4.p5.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathcal{V}}^{\text{GT}}_{\text{inter}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><mtext>inter</mtext><mtext>GT</mtext></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathcal{V}}^{\text{GT}}_{\text{inter}}</annotation></semantics></math> in Theorem <a href="#S3.Thmtheorem1" title="Theorem 3.1 (Variance collapse). ‣ 3.2 Theoretical explanation ‣ 3 Analysis ‣ Mint: A Simple Test-Time Adaptation of Vision-Language Models against Common Corruptions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.1</span></a>.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS4.p6" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS4.p6.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS4.p6.1.1" class="ltx_text">Finally, we compute the gradients w.r.t. four components of <math id="A2.SS4.p6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{w}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝒘</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{w}}</annotation></semantics></math> at initialization. Note that although the pseudo-labels <math id="A2.SS4.p6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{y}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{y}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> depend on the model parameters, this dependence involves an <math id="A2.SS4.p6.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\argmax" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>arg</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>max</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\argmax</annotation></semantics></math> operation and is thus non-differentiable. Therefore, during optimization, we treat the pseudo-labels as fixed constants and do not backpropagate through them. Let <math id="A2.SS4.p6.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C(\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i})=\frac{1}{(\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i})^{2}}+\frac{1}{(1-\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i})^{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C(\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i})=\frac{1}{(\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i})^{2}}+\frac{1}{(1-\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i})^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
<table id="A2.EGx32" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex49"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex49.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\nabla_{{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}}{\mathcal{V}}^{\text{PL}}_{\text{inter}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>cls</mtext></msup></msub><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><mtext>inter</mtext><mtext>PL</mtext></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\nabla_{{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}}{\mathcal{V}}^{\text{PL}}_{\text{inter}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex49.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{C(\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i})}{2}\cdot\frac{(4\sigma_{\hat{y}y}^{2}\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}\|_{2}^{2}-\|\bm{\sigma}_{\text{irr}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}\|_{2}^{2})+(4\sigma_{\hat{y}y}^{2}s^{2}\|\bm{\delta}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}}\|_{2}^{2})+(4\sigma_{\hat{y}y}^{2}\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}\|_{2}^{2}-\|\bm{\sigma}_{\text{noise}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}\|_{2}^{2})}{Z({\bm{w}},s)^{4}}\cdot" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝝈</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>𝜹</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>shift</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝝈</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒘</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.222em">⋅</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{C(\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i})}{2}\cdot\frac{(4\sigma_{\hat{y}y}^{2}\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}\|_{2}^{2}-\|\bm{\sigma}_{\text{irr}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}\|_{2}^{2})+(4\sigma_{\hat{y}y}^{2}s^{2}\|\bm{\delta}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}}\|_{2}^{2})+(4\sigma_{\hat{y}y}^{2}\|{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}\|_{2}^{2}-\|\bm{\sigma}_{\text{noise}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}\|_{2}^{2})}{Z({\bm{w}},s)^{4}}\cdot</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex50"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex50.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\quad\ 2{\bm{\mu}}^{2}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn> 2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>cls</mtext></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad\ 2{\bm{\mu}}^{2}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex51"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex51.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=C(\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i})\cdot\frac{(4\sigma_{\hat{y}y}^{2}d_{\text{irr}}-\|\bm{\sigma}_{\text{irr}}\|_{2}^{2})+4\sigma_{\hat{y}y}^{2}s^{2}\|\bm{\delta}\|_{2}^{2}+(4\sigma_{\hat{y}y}^{2}d_{\text{noise}}-\|\bm{\sigma}_{\text{noise}}\|_{2}^{2})}{(\|{\bm{\mu}}\|_{2}^{2}+d_{\text{irr}}+s^{2}\cdot(\|\bm{\delta}\|_{2}^{2}+d_{\text{noise}}))^{2}}\cdot{\bm{\mu}}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝝈</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝜹</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝝈</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝝁</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝜹</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=C(\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i})\cdot\frac{(4\sigma_{\hat{y}y}^{2}d_{\text{irr}}-\|\bm{\sigma}_{\text{irr}}\|_{2}^{2})+4\sigma_{\hat{y}y}^{2}s^{2}\|\bm{\delta}\|_{2}^{2}+(4\sigma_{\hat{y}y}^{2}d_{\text{noise}}-\|\bm{\sigma}_{\text{noise}}\|_{2}^{2})}{(\|{\bm{\mu}}\|_{2}^{2}+d_{\text{irr}}+s^{2}\cdot(\|\bm{\delta}\|_{2}^{2}+d_{\text{noise}}))^{2}}\cdot{\bm{\mu}}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex52"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex52.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\nabla_{{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}}}{\mathcal{V}}^{\text{PL}}_{\text{inter}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>shift</mtext></msup></msub><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><mtext>inter</mtext><mtext>PL</mtext></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\nabla_{{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}}}{\mathcal{V}}^{\text{PL}}_{\text{inter}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex52.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{C(\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i})}{2}\cdot-\frac{4\sigma_{\hat{y}y}^{2}\cdot\|{\bm{\mu}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}\|_{2}^{2}+\|\bm{\sigma}_{\text{irr}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}\|_{2}^{2}+\|\bm{\sigma}_{\text{noise}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}\|_{2}^{2}}{Z({\bm{w}},s)^{4}}\cdot s^{2}\cdot 2\bm{\delta}^{2}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>𝝁</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>cls</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝝈</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝝈</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi>𝒘</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒘</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>s</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>𝜹</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><mi>𝒘</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mtext>shift</mtext></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{C(\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i})}{2}\cdot-\frac{4\sigma_{\hat{y}y}^{2}\cdot\|{\bm{\mu}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{cls}}\|_{2}^{2}+\|\bm{\sigma}_{\text{irr}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{irr}}\|_{2}^{2}+\|\bm{\sigma}_{\text{noise}}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{noise}}\|_{2}^{2}}{Z({\bm{w}},s)^{4}}\cdot s^{2}\cdot 2\bm{\delta}^{2}\odot{\bm{w}}^{\text{shift}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex53"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex53.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=-C(\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i})\cdot\frac{{\mathcal{V}}^{\text{PL}}_{\text{inter}}}{\|{\bm{\mu}}\|_{2}^{2}+d_{\text{irr}}+s^{2}\cdot(\|\bm{\delta}\|_{2}^{2}+d_{\text{noise}})}\cdot s^{2}\cdot\bm{\delta}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mi>C</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><mtext>inter</mtext><mtext>PL</mtext></msubsup><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝝁</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>irr</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝜹</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>noise</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msup><mi>𝜹</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=-C(\mathbb{E}\hat{y}_{i})\cdot\frac{{\mathcal{V}}^{\text{PL}}_{\text{inter}}}{\|{\bm{\mu}}\|_{2}^{2}+d_{\text{irr}}+s^{2}\cdot(\|\bm{\delta}\|_{2}^{2}+d_{\text{noise}})}\cdot s^{2}\cdot\bm{\delta}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
