<section id="A3.SS8" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.8 </span>Experiments on ImageNet variants</h3>

<div id="A3.SS8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this subsection, we provide the comparison between <span id="A3.SS8.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Mint</span> and currently outstanding baselines, CLIPArTT <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib15" title="" class="ltx_ref">15</a>]</cite>, WATT-S <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib28" title="" class="ltx_ref">28</a>]</cite>, TDA <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib19" title="" class="ltx_ref">19</a>]</cite>, DMN-ZS <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib45" title="" class="ltx_ref">45</a>]</cite>, Tent <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib38" title="" class="ltx_ref">38</a>]</cite>, and ETA <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib26" title="" class="ltx_ref">26</a>]</cite> in ImageNet variants (-A, -V2, -R, -Sketch) datasets with ViT-B/16.</p>
</div>
